<title>USA: Syncor agrees to buy iodine business.</title>
<headline>Syncor agrees to buy iodine business.</headline>
<dateline>CHATSWORTH, Calif 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Syncor International Corp said it signed a letter of intent to purchase all of the assets related to Golden Pharmaceuticals Inc's Iodine 123 business.</p>
<p>Iodine 123 is a diagnostic product used to diagnose thyroid disorders and is distributed nationally by Syncor International.</p>
